/surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Price</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Cooper</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name><name><surname>Price</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>HEXIM2, a HEXIM1-related protein, regulates positive transcription elongation factor b through association with 7SK</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>2005</year><volume>280</volume><fpage>16360</fpage><lpage>16367</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15713662</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1074/jbc.M500424200</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Temesgen</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Warnke</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Kasten</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Current status of antiretroviral therapy</article-title><source>Expert Opin Pharmacother</source><year>2006</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>1541</fpage><lpage>1554</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16872258</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1517/14656566.7.12.1541</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>D'Aquila</surname><given-names>RT</given-names></name><name><surname>Schapiro</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Brun-Vezinet</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Clotet</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Conway</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Demeter</surname><given-names>LM</given-names></name><name><surname>Grant</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>VA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuritzkes</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></